OL,3,GNEWSAJailed man had 'foul and depraved'
OL,4,Achild rape images
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paedophile with a "foul and depraved"
OL,7,Fcollection of baby rape images, which
OL,8,Fwas uncovered by police after he was
OL,9,Fcaught online trying to meet a teenage
OL,10,Fboy for sex, has been jailed.
OL,12,FMartin Thompson, 42, from Sunderland,
OL,13,Fwas ensnared by an undercover police
OL,14,Fofficer posing as a 14-year-old boy on
OL,15,FSnapchat, Newcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FOfficers subsequently found hundreds of
OL,18,Findecent images of children on his
OL,19,Fphone and tablet, some of which he had
OL,20,Fsent to other paedophiles.
