OL,3,GNEWSAJailed man had 'foul and depraved'
OL,4,Achild rape images
OL,5,
OL,6,FThompson, who was jailed in 2005 for
OL,7,Findecently assaulting a girl, admitted
OL,8,Fseven new offences including attempting
OL,9,Fto engage in sexual communication with
OL,10,Fa child. He was jailed for three and a
OL,11,Fhalf years.
